                                    class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/50 border border-emerald-500/20 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(16,185,129,0.3)] animate-pulse"></span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-[9px] font-black uppercase text-slate-555 tracking-wider">LIVE_MESSENGER
